  Cell[TextData[{Cell[BoxData[RowBox[{"ReducexFactors", "[", "expr", ",",
         " ", "opts", "]"}]], "InlineFormula"], "  ", "applies the supported \
xFactorReduced and xTildeFactorReduced rules."}], "Usage"],
  Cell["Details", "NotesSection"], Cell["The lowercase x in ReducexFactors is \
part of the actual function name. The default symbolic options are \
Momenta->{1,2,3,4}, ChannelMomenta->{1,4} and ChannelMass->Mchannel.",
   "Notes"], Cell["These are older specialized four-point identities. Supply \
the correct channel and do not use them to assume unrelated internal lines \
are on shell in a summed amplitude.", "Notes"],
  Cell["For current diagram output, external x-factor expansion is normally \
already performed by diagramAmplitudes; see ExpandXFactors for an explicit \
model-aware operation.", "Notes"], Cell["Options", "NotesSection"],
  Cell[BoxData[GridBox[{{Cell["Option", "TableHeader"],
